<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">DOCTOR-APPROVED</view><view class="title">今天的护理清单</view><view class="subtitle">这里只执行医生已经发布的护理方案。AI可以整理步骤，但不能自行增减药物或剂量。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="section-title">今日任务</view>
  <view wx:if="{{items.length}}"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view><view class="list-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.instruction}}</view></view><view class="pill">{{item.status_label}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{!item.completed}}" class="primary task-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="complete">完成并存档</button></view></view>
  <view wx:else class="card empty">当前没有医生已发布的护理任务。请确认是否已经绑定就诊医院。</view>
  <view class="bottom-note">每次完成都会生成云端记录，医生可在本院病例的执行情况中查看。</view>
</view>
<role-tabs role="pet_owner" active="care"/>
